  Read the diagonal. V0 reproduces the sequential server and fails on the
  speculative one; V2 reproduces the seeded speculative server and fails on
  the sequential one. Each verifier is sound only against the decoding
  algorithm it assumes -- and which algorithm a provider runs is exactly what
  a client cannot check.

